# --- Large generated artifacts (regenerable from /common scripts + configs) ---
# Small results (CSVs, PNGs, JSON metrics) used for the phase comparisons ARE
# committed on purpose -- see phase1_baseline/results and
# phase2_proposed/results. Only bulky regenerable intermediates are ignored.
*.npy
*.npz
!phase1_baseline/results/**/*.npy
!phase2_proposed/results/**/*.npy
